This product contains no third-party source code. It has no runtime
dependencies beyond the Python standard library.

Third-party systems it reads, with the terms under which it reads them:

  Base mainnet public JSON-RPC endpoints (mainnet.base.org,
  base-rpc.publicnode.com, base.drpc.org, 1rpc.io/base)
    Read-only public blockchain state. No key, no account, no terms of
    service accepted. Requests are rate limited client-side.

  Uniswap v3 contracts on Base
    Public, permissionless smart contracts. Read via eth_call and
    eth_getLogs. No SDK, no API key, no Uniswap API terms engaged.

  B20 tokenized equity contracts on Base
    Public ERC-20 contracts. Read-only.

Keccak-256 is implemented from the published permutation specification in
core/keccak.py and is checked against published test vectors in
tests/test_core.py. No third-party hashing code is vendored.

Equity prices shown are pool prices read from Uniswap on Base. They are not
issuer data, not a market data feed, not investment advice.
